{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rDhBZqxiKZ1795169601.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>伊朗的比蘭雲特，成為首位門將當選亞洲足球先生。</p><p></p><p>34歲的比蘭雲特，力壓兩位沙特球員，成為歷來第五位伊朗代表，亦是首位門將奪得亞洲足球先生殊榮。</p><p></p><p>他表示感到無比驕傲，畢生難忘，希望能啟發更多伊朗年輕球員，向世界展示實力。比蘭雲特在世界盃對比利時的分組賽中，作出7次撲救，當選最佳球員，又協助他效力的泰拉克托，闖入亞冠精英盃十六強。</p><p></p><p>朝鮮的金景英，協助內古香贏得女子亞冠盃，當選為亞洲足球小姐。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.142831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:37:14.216163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T11:17:19.846408+00:00","content_hash":"2017c0cf69f4f67437b9fb0684654c5985e2018845e0660b3d214a5e7c4e82a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:24:02.142831+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}